Materiais de Construção Mecânica — Zolin (@mat-zolin: 0, is #reference, #part-of @mat-sources) { r_1KS5EGZJ8PBFDART80K21J1309
Ivan Zolin, *Materiais de Construção Mecânica*, third edition, UFSM/Colégio Técnico Industrial de Santa Maria, e-Tec Brasil, 2011, 76 PDF pages. [Official institutional PDF](https://www.ufsm.br/app/uploads/sites/413/2018/11/02_materiais_construcao_mecanica.pdf).

Read the whole short book and its exercises as a Portuguese technical introduction. Its five units survey metallic, polymeric, ceramic, composite and semiconductor materials. Sections 1.5 and 1.7 introduce crystal structure and properties; later units establish family vocabulary. Deepen simplified classifications and historical examples through the fuller linked sources and original investigations.

The PDF was retrieved outside the repository on 30 October 2026; cover, catalogue, contents and selected structure/property passages were inspected. The catalogue identifies the third edition and 2011 date; the upload path is not the publication year. CTISM copyright is stated, and the preface acknowledges its underlying references. Authorized institutional reading does not establish a blanket adaptation licence for the book or its figures. Keep it external.

**Return:** [Materials-engineering sources](../Sources.lingua#r_51JAH6DB4WV2HZAB69G21ZHSMK).
